  "Yes. Install the Hanzo CLI and sign in, then run Claude Code with its model calls going through api.hanzo.ai, or point your own Claude Code install at Hanzo. The commands are at the top of this page, ready to copy.": "是的。安裝 Hanzo CLI 並登入，然後執行 Claude Code，其模型呼叫將透過 api.hanzo.ai 進行，或將您自己的 Claude Code 安裝指向 Hanzo。指令位於本頁頂端，可直接複製。",
  "Each one is read when the page opens: the race and the boards from Hanzo's research runs, the prices from our price list, and the plans from our plan list. A figure whose source does not answer is left out, never replaced with an older one.": "頁面開啟時會讀取每一項資料：來自 Hanzo 研究執行的競賽與看板、來自我們價目表的價格，以及來自我們方案清單的方案。若某數值的來源未回應，則予以省略，絕不會以舊數值取代。",
  "Every board and its runs": "每個看板及其執行",
  "Free needs no card. Paid plans are sold by the month for one person and by the member for a team, and every paid plan can be cancelled any time. Enterprise is priced with our team.": "免費方案無需信用卡。付費方案以個人月費或團隊成員費計價，所有付費方案均可隨時取消。企業方案請與我們的團隊洽詢報價。",
